### Deep Agent Sample — HITL Test
### Requires: cds bind --exec -- cds watch tests/samples/deep-agent
### Note: orderProduct must have interruptOn configured in the agent for HITL to trigger

### 1. Send a message (normal flow)
POST http://localhost:4004/a2a/product-agent/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic alice:

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "message/send",
  "params": {
    "message": {
      "messageId": "msg-001",
      "role": "user",
      "parts": [{ "kind": "text", "text": "Show me all products" }]
    }
  }
}

###

### 2. Trigger HITL — order something (if interruptOn is configured for orderProduct)
POST http://localhost:4004/a2a/product-agent/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic alice:

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "method": "message/send",
  "params": {
    "message": {
      "messageId": "msg-002",
      "role": "user",
      "parts": [{ "kind": "text", "text": "Order 10 Widget Pro for me" }]
    }
  }
}

###

### 3. Resume — approve the action (replace TASK_ID with the id from response above)
POST http://localhost:4004/a2a/product-agent/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic alice:

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 3,
  "method": "message/send",
  "params": {
    "message": {
      "messageId": "msg-003",
      "role": "user",
      "taskId": "TASK_ID",
      "parts": [{ "kind": "text", "text": "approve" }]
    }
  }
}

###

### 4. Resume — reject the action (alternative to step 3)
POST http://localhost:4004/a2a/product-agent/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic alice:

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 4,
  "method": "message/send",
  "params": {
    "message": {
      "messageId": "msg-004",
      "role": "user",
      "taskId": "TASK_ID",
      "parts": [{ "kind": "text", "text": "reject" }]
    }
  }
}

###

### 5. Get task status (replace TASK_ID)
POST http://localhost:4004/a2a/product-agent/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic alice:

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 5,
  "method": "tasks/get",
  "params": {
    "id": "TASK_ID"
  }
}

###

### 6. Bulk pricing query (no HITL — completes directly)
POST http://localhost:4004/a2a/product-agent/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic alice:

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 6,
  "method": "message/send",
  "params": {
    "message": {
      "messageId": "msg-006",
      "role": "user",
      "parts": [{ "kind": "text", "text": "How much would 75 Widget Pros cost with volume discount?" }]
    }
  }
}

###

### Agent Card
GET http://localhost:4004/a2a/product-agent/.well-known/agent-card.json
